# Chunked transfer-decoding golden vectors (RFC 7230 section 4.1).
#
# NET-7.4's chunked BodyReader must decode <chunked-hex> to
# <decoded-hex> exactly. Chunk-extensions are parsed but ignored;
# trailers are consumed but not part of the body.
#
# Format (fields '|'-separated):
#   <name> | <chunked-body-hex> | <decoded-hex>
#   (an empty decoded body is the token <EMPTY>)
